&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join one of Catawiki’s main Development Verticals, &lt;strong&gt;Demand&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Supply&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Fulfilment&lt;/strong&gt;, and help us improve the experience of buyers, sellers, and internal teams across our platform. Working alongside Backend, Frontend, iOS, and Android Engineers, you’ll build product innovations for Catawiki’s apps and web app.&lt;br&gt;You’ll collaborate closely with QA, UX Designers, Product Managers, and with the support of a Tech Lead Manager to create beautiful, adaptable web frontends on top of scalable microservices. While your product area may vary, your goal will remain the same: deliver reliable, high-quality experiences that make a meaningful impact for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Catawiki, you will make an impact by improving and delivering product innovations for the Catawiki platform:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Build impactful product experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; by improving and delivering innovations across the Catawiki platform for buyers, sellers, customer service, and internal operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Create adaptable web frontends&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; on top of scalable microservices using our core frontend stack of TypeScript and ReactJS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Deliver responsive, accessible experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; that work well across desktop, tablet, and mobile screens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Optimise product performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; by measuring and monitoring systems and using insights to improve the experiences you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Experiment and learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; by partnering with Product Managers and UX Designers on A/B tests, using data analysis to validate ideas and iterate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Collaborate across disciplines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; with engineers, QA, design, and product colleagues to build scalable and maintainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a &lt;em&gt;Frontend Engineer&lt;/em&gt; with extensive frontend experience in multiple technologies, with an impressive portfolio of past frontend deliveries, and eager to expand your knowledge and impact, ready to take the next step in your career. As a Senior Developer, you are effective in lifting the level of your team, and you love to cooperate with Frontend Engineers of other teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Extensive frontend experience&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Demonstrated experience as a Frontend Engineer, using JavaScript or TypeScript as your main stack, with a strong portfolio of frontend deliveries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Strong web foundations&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Proficiency in JavaScript/TypeScript, HTML, and CSS, along with an understanding of HTTP/S, the Critical Rendering Path, CORS, caching, and CDNs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Modern frontend expertise&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Familiarity with libraries and frameworks such as ReactJS, NextJS, Redux, CSS Modules, Tailwind, and/or Rails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Product-focused collaboration&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Proven experience in product companies, working closely with engineers and Product Managers as part of an autonomous, cross-functional team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Production ownership&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Experience designing, implementing, deploying, monitoring, and managing applications with a focus on availability, latency, and consistency - you build it, you run it, you love it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Quality-minded engineering&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; An understanding of principles such as SOLID and DRY, with consideration for accessibility, security, SEO, performance, testing, observability, internationalisation, and typing when building features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Collaborate and grow with your team&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; You take initiative, welcome new challenges, help raise the level of your team, share knowledge across teams, and actively expand your skills and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Experiment, learn, and iterate&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; You validate ideas quickly, iterate based on insights, and are willing to discard what does not work - then build validated solutions for long-term scalability and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;NodeJS&lt;/strong&gt; and experience running it in production is a plus. It will help you collaborate effectively across the stack and optimise frontend-backend interactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Engineering teams are interdisciplinary, bringing together Backend, Frontend, iOS, and Android Engineers with QA, UX Design, Product Management, and Engineering leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Teams take ownership of their product area and work together to ship new features, learn new things, and pursue meaningful technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;We use a test-and-learn approach, combining experimentation and data with a focus on maintainability and long-term quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We value passionate engineers who have a strong eye for detail, take initiative, support their colleagues, and enjoy working in a diverse and dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You&#39;ll Be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role based in Amsterdam.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;You will work from our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam HQ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are only considering candidates who are already based in&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;the &lt;strong&gt;Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;relocation support is not available for this position&lt;/span&gt;. We can, however, &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;provide visa transfer from current Dutch employer&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;800+ Catawikians&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/span&gt; depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work From Home Allowance&lt;/span&gt; to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commuting&lt;/span&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Office&lt;/span&gt; right in the centre of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Execution team plays a crucial role in driving the rocketship growth of Celonis. As Business Partners to the Sales leadership, we prepare &amp;amp; drive decision making, foster execution and help steer the business. Across the team, you will find a mix of projects in strategic planning, sales operations, finance, and business analytics – requiring a mix of strategy, go-to-market design, market analysis, sales optimization, and business operational support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report directly to the VP EMEA APAC Revenue Strategy &amp;amp; Operations and be based out of our multicultural and vibrant office in Munich.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;As an Intern in Strategy &amp;amp; Operations you will play a key part in supporting EMEA leadership to drive and execute on the continued success of Celonis by supporting our business growth strategy. Sample projects range from highly strategic to operational including evaluating market opportunities, business planning, process optimization and regular review of key performance metrics. The role requires interaction with various areas of the organization and provides exposure to senior executives. You will be working closely with stakeholders from other Celonis departments like Value Engineering, Marketing, Process &amp;amp; Tools, Analytics, Finance, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the annual EMEA planning process, including organizational design, territory carving, comp plan design and target setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define GTM strategy- including sales territory design, analysis and presentation of Market Opportunity to drive Celonis penetration into different regional markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage internal and external data to provide actionable commercial insights that can deliver revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic projects into the execution phase and partner with teams across the organization to deliver on implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key opportunities for business improvement through analytics &amp;amp; quantitative insights&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run Regional and EMEA Wide forecasting, sales performance and dem generation governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree program in Business, Economics, or a related field (or holding a completed Bachelor&#39;s degree)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First Experience in Sales Operations, SaaS business, Consulting or Investment Banking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in MS Excel and PPT or G-suite tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in spoken and written English (Additional language is a plus, but not a must)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-driven, detail-oriented, self-motivated with the ability to work independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Salesforce is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Munich and able to work one-site from the Celonis Munich Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pallet &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pallet is building AI Agents to transform the physical economy, a $12 trillion global TAM. We’ve raised $50M from top investors, including General Catalyst, Bessemer Venture Partners, and Bain Capital Ventures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to increase the efficiency of the global supply chain by automating the manual workflows that slow supply chain teams down. Our flagship platform provides end-to-end visibility, and control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As companies across the physical economy look to drive efficiency, many are turning to Pallet to lead the way. With deep supply chain expertise and cutting-edge AI capabilities, we’re positioned to build the next $10B company powering the physical economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and work alongside leaders from Google, DoorDash, YC, and more to shape the future of supply chain technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London, United Kingdom (Remote to start, transitioning to 5 days/week in-office in London)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You could be an Enterprise Account Executive anywhere. Why us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a well-funded, high-growth startup on a clear path to $100M ARR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell a category-defining AI Agents platform with massive surface area across logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Pallet’s presence across Europe as one of the first commercial hires on the ground.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with founders and senior leadership to define our international go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help transform one of the world’s largest industries while building toward a $10B+ outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring our first Founding Enterprise Account Executives in EMEA to build Pallet’s commercial presence across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own net-new enterprise acquisition across the region, build relationships with the largest logistics providers in Europe, and help establish the playbook for our international expansion. This is a highly consultative enterprise sales role focused on educating customers on an entirely new category of AI-powered workflow automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Sales, Product, Engineering, Solutions, and Customer Success to drive a solution-selling motion centered around workflow discovery, AI use case identification, structured pilots, and measurable ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initially, this role will be remote from London while we establish our UK presence. Once our London office opens, this role will transition to working from the office five days per week when not traveling to customer sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full enterprise sales cycle across EMEA, from outbound prospecting through contract signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a 3x-4x qualified pipeline through disciplined outbound execution while self-sourcing at least 30% of opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with executive stakeholders across Europe’s largest logistics providers, including COO, CIO, VP Operations, VP Supply Chain, and VP Technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative discovery sessions that map operational workflows to Pallet’s AI agent capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope and lead structured pilots that demonstrate measurable operational ROI and convert into enterprise deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive business cases that align operational improvements with financial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document repeatable customer use cases and market feedback to shape Pallet’s product roadmap and international GTM strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish Pallet as the leading AI platform for enterprise logistics across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of enterprise B2B SaaS or enterprise logistics sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent German: you can run discovery, negotiate and present to executives in German.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently closing six- and seven-figure enterprise software agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative selling and value-based sales methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex buying committees and long enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with senior operators and technology leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable selling technical, workflow-heavy software products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly understand complex logistics operations and translate them into compelling AI automation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent outbound prospecting and territory-building discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience selling into logistics, supply chain, transportation, or warehouse operations is strongly preferred but not required. Candidates without logistics experience should demonstrate an ability to quickly learn operational workflows and become trusted advisors to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working hours are generally &lt;strong&gt;9:00am-6:00pm London time&lt;/strong&gt;, providing full coverage of the European business day while maintaining regular collaboration with our San Francisco headquarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll typically spend:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mornings and early afternoons working directly with European customers and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Late afternoons collaborating with our US-based Sales, Product, and Engineering teams during our daily overlap window.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 75% of your time traveling across Europe for customer meetings, executive workshops, pilots, and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initially this role will be remote from London. Once Pallet opens its London office, you’ll work from the office five days per week whenever you’re not traveling to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report directly to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;VP of Global Revenue&lt;/strong&gt;, for territory strategy, customer relationships, and international expansion and will participate in weekly pipeline reviews, forecasting, and sales process alignment with the US team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chat with Christy - Business Recruiter - 30 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal Review - 30 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discovery Mock Interview - 45-60 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final Interview - ~2.5 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief Background Check and Reference Check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, and we’ll keep you informed at every stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated compensation range for this role is &lt;strong&gt;£220,000-£240,000 OTE&lt;/strong&gt;, 50/50 split, depending on experience and skill set.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation follows a standard 50/50 enterprise sales structure consisting of base salary and target commission. High performers are eligible for uncapped commission accelerators above quota.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, we offer competitive equity, benefits, and significant growth opportunities as one of our earliest international commercial hires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Final compensation will be determined based on experience, qualifications, and demonstrated enterprise sales performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our people the same way we invest in our product: seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🩺 Health, Vision, and Dental benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏝️ Take-what-you-need Paid Vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;➕ Life Insurance and Accidental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;❤️‍🩹 Short-Term Disability Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 Generous salary and equity for all staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🪜 401k option; helping you save for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🧑‍🧑‍🧒‍🧒 Paid parental leave to support growing families&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 Yearly learning and development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚌 Commuter benefits for Bay Area and New York employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚘 Uber ride stipend if you ever have to work late in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏡 Remote office home stipend to get you comfy in your space for remote employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;📸 Free professional headshot&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍔 Daily catered lunches and dinners provided in office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💪 Complimentary On-Site Gym: Our SF office has a fully equipped gym&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✈️ Onboarding trip to one of our offices if you work remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🥤 Monthly happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎉 Annual Company Offsites; our last one was in Palm Springs CA 🌴&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an in-person company. Our offices in San Francisco, New York City and London are where ideas get built, decisions get made, and the team gets stronger. We have invested in making them genuinely great places to spend your day, with catered lunches, monthly happy hours, and people who care about the work and each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most of our team works in office five days a week. For select roles, we hire remotely across the U.S. Remote employees come to one of our offices for their first week to onboard and meet the team, and we cover the full trip.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every role is different. Travel expectations are always shared upfront in the job description and confirmed in your first call with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pallet is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We make all employment decisions based solely on merit. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants and employees without discrimination on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, disability status, or any other applicable legally protected characteristic. We prohibit any form of discrimination or harassment. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including hiring.&lt;/p&gt;
