&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A consultative approach, with the curiosity to understand customers and the commercial instinct to spot opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
